doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Patil et al. designed SVM-based key features to construct RUL classification and regression models to simultaneously and concurrently accomplish accurate RUL prediction of multiple batteries." .
_:bdb464f501b9460b58b8d76544653974 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Patil et al. designed SVM-based key features to construct RUL classification and regression models to simultaneously and concurrently accomplish accurate RUL prediction of multiple batteries." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:b1e3052f42ca .
doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Wang et al. proposed an improved black widow algorithm for optimizing the ELM for RUL estimation of LIBs, which was tested under different temperatures and charging/discharging strategies to prove its strong generalization and robustness." .
_:ed5a6845f0eff7bdb6fcb46b83a9920e rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Wang et al. proposed an improved black widow algorithm for optimizing the ELM for RUL estimation of LIBs, which was tested under different temperatures and charging/discharging strategies to prove its strong generalization and robustness." )>> ;
