doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Data-driven estimation methods do not require a physical model of the battery, and the model is trained by observable data of external battery parameters to map the nonlinear relationship between the external parameters and SOH and RUL." .
_:d824d3d224d99a6ca311c7668c6fd566 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Data-driven estimation methods do not require a physical model of the battery, and the model is trained by observable data of external battery parameters to map the nonlinear relationship between the external parameters and SOH and RUL." )>> ;
