doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Zhou et al. investigated a SOH and RUL estimation method based on the improved Gray Wolf optimization algorithm for deep ELM models to analyze the aging state of the batteries at multiple scales and verified the accuracy and robustness of the used method." .
_:b23c7018f5c0c8856daab9aeb9a130ee rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factstitle1_12 <http://www.semanticweb.org/j.montero-jimenez/ontologies/2021/2/OPMAD#has_text_value> "Zhou et al. investigated a SOH and RUL estimation method based on the improved Gray Wolf optimization algorithm for deep ELM models to analyze the aging state of the batteries at multiple scales and verified the accuracy and robustness of the used method." )>> ;
